[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうだ。拙者、この道中で新しい忍術を\n思いついたのでございまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Actually, I came up with a new ninja technique on our way here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "え、急にどうしたの……？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? What brought that on...?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ、始まったか！\n鬼門の新忍術披露の時間が……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh no, here we go! I guess it's time for another one of Kimon's new technique demonstrations..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "恒例なの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This happens regularly?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門は鏑矢に感化され\n古きを捨て新しき忍術を追求する革新派なんだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon was influenced by Kaburaya and became a progressive ninja who abandons the old ways in pursuit of the new."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だが、大体は……\nまあ、見れば分かるか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But usually they're... Well, you'll see for yourself."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "では早速、新たに編み出した\n「縮地の術・改」をご覧に入れましょう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Allow me to demonstrate my newly developed World-Moving Technique - Modified."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しゅくち……？\u3000ってなに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "World-moving? What?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "文字通り地を縮める……遠くの場所に\n一瞬で移動する術でございまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Literally moving objects... a technique to instantly move things over large distances."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "今回はその応用……自身ではなく、\n触れているものを離れた場所に移動させる術",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "So here's the idea—instead of moving my body, I move something that I touch to a distant location."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "おお、面白そう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ooh, that sounds interesting!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "この術を用い、アルビーナ殿を一瞬で\n動かして差し上げまする……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Using this technique, I shall move you instantly, Miss Alvina..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よし、ばっちこーい！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright, let's see it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "疾っ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Swift as wind!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "姉様！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ひゃあぁっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Whaaaa?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うんっ……っと。大丈夫？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Are you okay?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ありがとう、びっくりしたぁ……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That gave me a shock..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううむ、位置の調整がなかなか難しい。\nアルビーナ殿、申し訳ない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hmm, positioning using this technique is quite difficult to adjust. My apologies, Miss Alvina."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ううん、大丈夫！\u3000ちょっと楽しかったし！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "No, that was great! It was actually kind of fun!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……壁の中に封じ込められなくてよかった。\nこの新術で暴走する癖がなければいい忍びなんだが……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good thing you weren't sealed inside a wall. If only this habit of going overboard with new techniques could be fixed, Kimon would be a fine ninja..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "鬼門、例によってその忍術は安定するまで封印だぞ。\nもしくは使うなら敵にのみだ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "As usual, that technique is banned until it's stable. Or perhaps reserve it for enemies."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "永遠",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Towa"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "むぅ……まあ、よいか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mmm... Very well then."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ねえ、他にも色んな忍術があるんでしょ？\n見せて見せて！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, you must know lots of other ninja techniques too, right? Please do show me!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ええ、では安定した術を……\nソフィー殿、拙者の目を見てくだされ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Very well, let me demonstrate something more developed... Miss Sophie, please look into my eyes."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こう？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Like this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "忍法、猫降ろし！\u3000はっ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ninja Art: Cat Possession! Ha!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あの、いったいにゃんの忍術だったにゃ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Um, what kind of technique was that, meow?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……にゃっ！？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Meow?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これは語尾と「な」が猫語になる忍術でございまする",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This technique turns sentence endings and certain sounds into cat speech."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あらかわいい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aww, how cute!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "これはお見事",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quite impressive."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ベップ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Bepp"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "にゃ、にゃにそれ！\n面白いけど、術を解いてほしいにゃ～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Meow, what is this?! It's funny, but please undo it now, meow!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "解く術については、まだ開発中でございまする！\nなに、小一時間もすれば自然と猫が抜けまするよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I'm still working on the technique for undoing it... But don't worry, it will naturally fade in about an hour."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "鬼門",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Kimon"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "か、勘弁してほしいにゃ～！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "A-an hour, meow!?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]